					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2008-06-08 | Sunday</font></strong><br><br><div align="center"><strong>An amazing line up for an amazing Cause<br /><br />NOISE FOR THE NEEDY PRESENTS...<br /><br />A Benefit for Urban Rest Stop<br /><br />TALIB KWELI<br />COMMON MARKET<br />GABRIEL TEODROS<br />GRAYSKUL<br /><br />9PM ALL AGES<br /><br />THE SHOWBOX<br /><br /><a href="http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/0F00408EE5B17C7C?">CLICK HERE FOR TICKETS</a><br /><br /><br /></strong></div><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2008-06-07 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2008-06-07 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br><div style="text-align: center">SEATTLE!!! </div><div style="text-align: center"><br /></div><div style="text-align: center">Nam &quot;Exhale&quot; CD Release Party</div><div style="text-align: center">featuring</div><div style="text-align: center"><br /></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">THE PHYSICS</span></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">BAMBU w/DJ Phatrick</span></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">and</span></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">Good Medicine </span></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">(Geologic of Blue Scholars, </span></div><div style="text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">Abyssinian Creole and Macklemore)</span></div><div style="text-align: center"><br /></div><div style="text-align: center">[peep flyer above for more info - i&#39;ll pho sho be thurr]</div><div style="text-align: center"><br /></div><div style="text-align: center">peace</div><div style="text-align: center">dj daps1</div><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2008-06-05 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br><strong>YO SEATTLE!!!<br /><br />MANOJ</strong> has finally made its way back home and will be appearing at the <em>Seattle True Independent Film Festival</em> this Tuesday, June 10th at 6:15 pm. Here&#39;s the information:<br /><br /><div align="center"><strong>Seattle True Independent Film Festival </strong><br /><strong>(Playing in Short Program 4)</strong><br />
</div><br /><div align="center"><strong>Tuesday, June 10th, 6:15 PM, Jewelbox Theater in Rendezvous </strong><br /></div><div align="center"><strong>2322 2nd Avenue, Seattle, WA, 98121, $8 </strong><br /><br /></div><br />Buy Tickets here:<br /><a href="http://stiff.bside.com/2008/films/manoj_stiff2008;jsessionid=04D62CE86882E481B0F16AE23C5F943A" target="_blank">http://stiff.bside.com/2008/films/manoj_stiff2008;jsessionid=04D62CE86882E481B0F16AE23C5F943A</a><br /><br />Also here&#39;s an article from <em>The Stranger</em> about MANOJ Director and Massline family member <strong>Zia Mohajerjasbi</strong>:<br /><a href="http://www.thestranger.com/seattle/Content?oid=592336&amp;fm" target="_blank">http://www.thestranger.com/seattle/Content?oid=592336&amp;fm</a><br /><br /><img src="http://img374.imageshack.us/img374/4273/introspectivemanojcj0.jpg" alt="" /><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2008-05-01 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br>Yo LOS ANGELES!<br /><br /><strong>MANOJ</strong> is making its LA Premiere this Sunday, May 4th at the <strong>Los Angeles Asian Pacific Film Festival</strong>!<br /><br />Here are the details:<br /><br /><div align="center"><strong><em>Los Angeles Asian Pacific Film Festival</em></strong><br /><strong><em>(Playing in the &quot;THIS IS WHO I AM&quot; Shorts Program)</em></strong><br /><br /><strong><em>Sunday, May 4th, 3:30 PM, </em></strong><br /><strong><em>Directors Guild of America,</em></strong><br /><strong><em>Theater 3 (7920 Sunset Blvd., West Hollywood, CA),</em></strong><br /><strong><em>$10 General, $8 Students and Seniors</em></strong><br /><br />
<a href="http://www.vconline.org/festival/program.cfm?program_id=68" target="_blank">http://www.vconline.org/festival/program.cfm?program_id=68</a><br />
</div><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><div style="text-align: center"><img src="http://img227.imageshack.us/img227/5082/manojshot2bx2.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br /></div>It&rsquo;s been a good year for MANOJ with appearances at the <em>San Francisco International Asian American Film Festival</em>, the <em>Global ComedyFes<strong>t</strong> </em>in Vancouver and a Finalist selection at the<strong> </strong><em>Boston Motion Picture Awards</em>. It should keep getting better with future festival dates in <strong>Houston</strong>,<strong> </strong><strong>Seattle</strong> and<strong> </strong><strong>New York City</strong> coming up! We&rsquo;ll keep you posted as we get more info!<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><center><div class="pagenumbers"><A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[&lt;&lt;]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=0">[1]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=5">[2]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[3]</A> [4] <A HREF="archive.php?from=20">[5]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=25">[6]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=30">[7]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=35">[8]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=40">[9]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=45">[10]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=50">[11]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=55">[12]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[13]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=65">[14]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=70">[15]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[16]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=80">[17]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=85">[18]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=90">[19]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=95">[20]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=100">[21]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=105">[22]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=110">[23]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=115">[24]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=120">[25]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=125">[26]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=130">[27]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=135">[28]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=140">[29]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=145">[30]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=150">[31]</A> <A